Version: 3.8.0

[CHANGELOG]
・Added new feature "Mo Eeyo" (Enough Already)
Can force skip hiding time and answer reveal time by a unanimous vote.
・Added new feature "BAN"
The BAN list resets when the server is restarted.

・Fixed an issue where hidden objects still had collision detection.
・Fixed an issue where the camera moved abruptly when getting close to a wall while hiding.
・Fixed an issue where players would become invisible during the answer reveal under certain conditions.
・Fixed an issue where the player's jump height was too high.
・Fixed an issue where hunters in TPS mode faced further upward than the direction they were actually looking.
・The mic icon now lights up green when speaking in voice chat.
・Fixed an issue where controller UI navigation was difficult in the User Management tab.